Gerhard is an elven fluid master in the [[Geography/Istria/Iomenei/Undercroft|Undercroft]] of [[Geography/Istria/Iomenei/index|Iomenei]]. He was born on the ship and has worked on it for as long as anyone can remember. The people who work near him describe him as a nice man who does his work and is friendly to chat with, but none of them know anything about his personal life; he held a surprise birthday party for one of the other fluid masters a few months before the sabotage.

He is the saboteur behind the recent troubles in Iomenei. He wedged a piece of scrap metal into a lubricant line in Strider Leg Armature Containment Unit 14, and when the line was read, his face came back: an elf with a jaw split into mandibles and small closed eyelids dotted around his eyes. He had scratched the mark of a horn inside a circle, the symbol of [[Divinity/Ashen Pact/Herald|Herald]], into the bedpost by the mattress where he slept; touching it brought a sudden cold that numbed the finger. He had begun to spend his off hours walking into the forsaken sector at the edge of the Undercroft, and he was not there when the party followed him in. The search for him goes on.
